      <ul class="rp-check"><li>Tongkat Ali centered</li><li>Zinc and boron support</li><li>100% grass-fed bovine gelatin</li><li>Two gummies per serving</li><li>Full formula disclosed</li></ul>

      <div class="rp-panel" id="rp-buy-{{ section.id }}" data-rp-form>
        {%- assign rp_has_app = false -%}{%- for block in section.blocks -%}{%- if block.type == '@app' -%}{%- assign rp_has_app = true -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
